# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Functions run classical and quantum work as a managed service on IBM Quantum Platform. Choose a pre-built function from the [Functions Catalog](#ibm-quantum-functions-catalog), or run your own code as a [managed workflow](#managed-workflows).\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Functions menjalankan kerja klasik dan kuantum sebagai perkhidmatan terurus di IBM Quantum Platform. Pilih fungsi siap bina daripada [Functions Catalog](#ibm-quantum-functions-catalog), atau jalankan kod anda sendiri sebagai [managed workflow](#managed-workflows).\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Functions Catalog {#ibm-quantum-functions-catalog}"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Functions Catalog {#ibm-quantum-functions-catalog}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The IBM Quantum Functions Catalog (`qiskit-ibm-catalog.FunctionsCatalog`) offers pre-built services from IBM and partners, designed to accelerate algorithm discovery and application prototyping. Explore the [Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), including:\n"
msgstr "IBM Quantum Functions Catalog (`qiskit-ibm-catalog.FunctionsCatalog`) menawarkan perkhidmatan siap bina daripada IBM dan rakan kongsi, yang direka untuk mempercepatkan penemuan algoritma dan pembangunan prototaip aplikasi. Terokai [Functions Catalog](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/functions), termasuk:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-30
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Circuit functions**: Services that include transpilation, error suppression, error mitigation, and post-processing techniques that take abstract circuits and desired measurement observables as input. With Circuit functions, users can discover new algorithms and applications without needing to manage transpilation or quantum hardware performance.\n"
msgstr "**Circuit functions**: Perkhidmatan yang merangkumi transpilasi, penindasan ralat, pengurangan ralat, dan teknik pasca-pemprosesan yang mengambil litar abstrak dan observable pengukuran yang diingini sebagai input. Dengan Circuit functions, pengguna boleh menemui algoritma dan aplikasi baru tanpa perlu mengurus transpilasi atau prestasi perkakasan kuantum.\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-30
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Application functions**: Services that include entire quantum workflows, from mapping classical to quantum, optimizing for hardware, execution on hardware, and post-processing. Users can prototype industry applications with domain-familiar inputs and outputs.\n"
msgstr "**Application functions**: Perkhidmatan yang merangkumi keseluruhan aliran kerja kuantum, dari pemetaan klasikal ke kuantum, pengoptimuman untuk perkakasan, pelaksanaan pada perkakasan, dan pasca-pemprosesan. Pengguna boleh memprototaipkan aplikasi industri dengan input dan output yang biasa dalam domain mereka.\n"

