#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed workflows {#managed-workflows}"
msgstr "Aliran kerja terurus {#managed-workflows}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Creating utility-scale quantum applications generally requires a variety of compute resource requirements. Managed workflows run your own Python code on classical compute that IBM Quantum Platform manages for you, alongside the quantum hardware. Functions also manages the environment: it sets up storage, and installs and pre-compiles all packages before your job starts. Use a managed workflow to:\n"
msgstr "Mencipta aplikasi kuantum berskala utiliti biasanya memerlukan pelbagai keperluan sumber pengkomputeran. Managed workflows menjalankan kod Python anda sendiri pada pengkomputeran klasik yang diuruskan oleh IBM Quantum Platform untuk anda, bersama perkakasan kuantum. Functions juga menguruskan persekitaran: ia menyediakan storan, serta memasang dan memprakompil semua pakej sebelum job anda bermula. Gunakan managed workflow untuk:\n"

# doq: fixed after review 2026-09-29
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Persist long-running workloads in the cloud, even if your laptop is turned off\n"
msgstr "Mengekalkan beban kerja jangka panjang agar terus berjalan di awan, walaupun komputer riba anda dimatikan\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use large-memory and GPU nodes by choosing a compute profile\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan nod memori besar dan GPU dengan memilih profil pengkomputeran\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Parallelize classical tasks, such as pre-processing and post-processing\n"
msgstr "Memparalelkan tugas klasikal, seperti pra-pemprosesan dan pasca-pemprosesan\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deploy reusable programs in the cloud\n"
msgstr "Menyebarkan program yang boleh digunakan semula di awan\n"

